# slug (no shell)
sprite slug
tags creature ground tiny slow
anchor 7 4
palette
  m a05a2a ~6
  M 7a4020 ~4
  K 4a2614 ~2
  s c88a52
  o 1a100a
end

frame crawl0
|............Mo
|......mmmm.MM
|mmmmmmKsMKmK
|KKKKKKKKKKKm
|.

frame crawl1
|.............Mo
|......mmmmm.MM
|mmmmmmKMsMmmK
|KKKKKKKKKKKKm
|.


clip idle loop fps=1 : crawl0
